  "summary": "Papa John's must procure and maintain comprehensive general liability insurance of at least $5,000,000 USD or standard policy limits (whichever is greater) for the Term and 3 years thereafter, naming ABG, Celebrity, and Authentic Brands Group as additional insureds.",
